OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of bright spells and
OL,6,Fblustery showers, some heavy. A windy
OL,7,Fday too with fresh to strong
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly winds, with gales
OL,9,Ftowards the north coast in the
OL,10,Fmorning. The winds easing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOccasional showers will
OL,13,Fcontinue this evening and tonight
OL,14,Fespecially over the north and west,
OL,15,Fbut with some drier and clearer
OL,16,Fintervals too. Moderate to fresh
OL,17,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
