OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA few light showers
OL,6,Fpossible in the morning then becoming
OL,7,Fdry and bright with some sunny
OL,8,Fintervals.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,12,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,13,FSome sunshine around too. Cloudy on
OL,14,FFriday and Saturday with occasional
OL,15,Frain, perhaps brighter later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
